# Stable spec ID: iba-whiskey-sour. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(bourbon) 45 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 25 ml
(simple syrup) 20 ml
(egg: white, optional) few drops

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(cobbler glass)
(old-fashioned glass)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker), more vigorously if using egg white>
[
    <strain, into (cobbler glass)>
]
-OR-
[
    <strain, into an ice-filled (old-fashioned glass)>
]
<garnish, with half an orange slice and maraschino cherry>
Optional [
    <garnish, with orange zest>
]

